Sí, hazlo.

352
00:20:21,678 --> 00:20:24,181
"Tu amigo Tyler acaba de unirse.
Salúdalo".

353
00:20:26,016 --> 00:20:27,184
Vamos.

354
00:20:27,267 --> 00:20:28,769
Salúdalo.

355
00:20:29,394 --> 00:20:31,647
